  "description": "Bring classic holiday charm to your creative projects with this 15 Christmas Colors Horizontal Stripes Seamless Pattern collection. Featuring festive Christmas-inspired color combinations in clean horizontal stripe designs, this versatile set is perfect for digital paper, scrapbooking, Christmas cards, invitations, gift wrapping, fabric, stationery, packaging, backgrounds, sublimation, and holiday crafts. The seamless repeating format makes these designs easy to use for both personal and commercial creative projects.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Christmas digital paper and scrapbook projects\n•Holiday invitations and greeting cards\n•Gift tags, wrapping paper, and packaging\n•Christmas party decorations\n•Fabric and textile designs\n•Planner and journal backgrounds\n•Social media graphics and website backgrounds\n•Cricut and Silhouette crafts\n•Sublimation and printable projects\n•Seasonal branding and stationery",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring classic holiday charm to your creative projects with this 15 Christmas Colors Horizontal Stripes Seamless Pattern collection. Featuring festive Christmas-inspired color combinations in clean horizontal stripe designs, this versatile set is perfect for digital paper, scrapbooking, Christmas cards, invitations, gift wrapping, fabric, stationery, packaging, backgrounds, sublimation, and holiday crafts. The seamless repeating format makes these designs easy to use for both personal and commercial creative projects.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n•15 seamless patterns<br>\n•Format: JPEG<br>\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n•High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n•Christmas digital paper and scrapbook projects<br>\n•Holiday invitations and greeting cards<br>\n•Gift tags, wrapping paper, and packaging<br>\n•Christmas party decorations<br>\n•Fabric and textile designs<br>\n•Planner and journal backgrounds<br>\n•Social media graphics and website backgrounds<br>\n•Cricut and Silhouette crafts<br>\n•Sublimation and printable projects<br>\n•Seasonal branding and stationery</p>",
